ch came in under 90% of normal in 36 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. In 2025 the middle ran 165% of normal in April to May and 37% in July to August. This year January to February came in at 27% of normal for 2026 on the middle of the grids. All 6 grids had their driest year in 1963, and grid 20571 got just 56% of normal that year.</p>"}
